# DainRaku OS — Kali Linux mirror overlay
# The signing key ships alongside this file as kali-rolling.key.chroot, which
# live-build installs into the chroot's trusted keyrings BEFORE it runs apt
# update in the bootstrap/archives stage. This lets Kali-only tools resolve.
deb http://http.kali.org/kali kali-rolling main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
